# Kingdoms and states. Epic ones carry the age they belong to; historical ones take their years from Wikidata.
# Territories are the places listed with aoa:locatedIn; extents are in graph/extents.ttl and from Cliopatria.

@prefix : <https://w3id.org/atlas-of-ages#> .
@prefix aoa: <https://w3id.org/atlas-of-ages#> .
